        │                                                              │        
        │ Main screen                                                  │        
        │  ↑↓ j k   select a preset                                    │        
        │  enter    open it: agents, model, permissions                │        
        │  e        equip it (write it into ~/.claude, after a previe… │        
        │  t        try it: start claude with it, writing nothing      │        
        │  n c r d  new, clone, rename, delete                         │        
        │  i x      import a shared preset, export the selected one    │        
        │  /        filter the list                                    │        
        │                                                              │        
        │ Editing                                                      │        
        │  esc      go back; changes are saved as you make them        │        
        │  ctrl+c   quit from anywhere                                 │        
        │                                                              │        
        │ Your original setup (◇ initial) is never changed.            │        
        │ `squad restore` brings it back at any time.                  │        
        │                                                              │        
